SUMMARY:Derby Day With MHA!
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we watch the Kentucky Derby live and raise funds for mental health!\nJoin the Mental Health Association for an afternoon of excitement\, connection\, and community at Derby Day with MHA. Guests will enjoy an exciting celebration inspired by the Kentucky Derby\, complete with delicious food\, refreshing drinks\, and plenty of opportunities for friendly competition. \nCheer on the horses as we watch the Kentucky Derby live\, show off your Derby best in our hat and bow tie contests\, and take part in themed games and activities throughout the afternoon. With great company\, spirited fun\, and a shared commitment to mental health\, Derby Day with MHA promises an unforgettable experience all in support of programs that strengthen our community. \n  \nWHEN: May 2\, 2026\nTIME: 4 PM TO 8 PM\nWHERE: Yogi Berra Museum and Learning Center\n8 Yogi Berra Drive\, Little Falls\, NJ 07424 \n  \nClick here to purchase tickets or for more information.
URL:https://www.mhainspire.org/event/derby-day-with-mha/
LOCATION:Yogi Berra Museum\, 8 Yogi Berra Drive\, Little Falls\, NJ\, 07424\, United States
CATEGORIES:Fundraising Events
END:VEVENT
